        "text_KWaPr7MOqq3NGeZQ-1": "<h3>Any Questions?</h3>",
        "text_988xMxasWMhGPGyc-1": "<h3>We have answers</h3>",
        "text_0tB7Gwk9mM3tvdzs-1": "<p>What does flavored air taste like?</p>",
        "text_LiOaB4aedqqXHLMz-1": "<p>Lio's flavored vapor offers a subtle, natural taste that helps you quit smoking or vaping. It's less intense than vapor, yet refreshing, similar to a lightly steeped herbal tea or soda, but without the sweetness.</p>",
        "text_ga18m9KV5dlemZXE-1": "<p>How does Lio work?</p>",
        "text_B6iXQx2EAYvnjQZJ-1": "<p>Lio offers nicotine-free, naturally flavored vapor to help you effortlessly break bad habits. 100% natural and 90% cheaper than smoking, it helps maintain the habit of \"hand-to-mouth\" for an easy transition. Trusted by over 100,000 customers and with a 30-day money-back guarantee, it's the easiest choice for a healthier life.</p>",
        "text_fvV6r4tXrJ46h3XU-1": "<p>How do you use Lio?</p>",
        "text_9XYA1ESp73pjMPeo-1": "<p>Using your Lio is easy, just 3 steps.</p><p>Fray the core of your favorite flavor. </p><p>Slide the core into the Lio. </p><p>Relieve your cravings.</p>",
        "text_yTyLSFSIdKvwQz23-1": "<p>Shipping and refunds</p>",
        "text_qXRj2jzf9K0nD65S-1": "<p>We ship worldwide for free from the Netherlands with PostNL! Delivery time is 2-3 days within Europe, 3-4 days to the UK, 4-8 days outside Europe, and next-day delivery to the Middle East (from Dubai). Enjoy fast, reliable shipping at no extra cost.</p>",
        "text_qxobWm2DH8k2US4T-1": "<p>Money-back guarantee</p>",
        "text_TCUBltGYiGEngco3-1": "<p>Have you used Lio™? Then take 30 days to experience the benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you're not satisfied. This gives you plenty of time to fully experience its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_w43j8adfJH7d06zN-1": "<p>Is Lio safe?</p>",
        "text_ZnSwS8ZRwsq2QBjk-1": "<p>Absolutely! Lio is made with 100% natural ingredients, including essential oils, plant extracts, and natural flavors. It's completely free of nicotine, chemicals, or harmful toxins, making it a safe and clean alternative to smoking and vaping.</p>",
        "text_D1m61lacE1bDpQr5-1": "<p>How long do Flavor Cores last?</p>",
        "text_nDsOfUGKMsXORU4M-1": "<p>Each Flavor Core is designed to last 2 to 3 days with regular use, depending on how often you use your Lio. A pack of six cores provides enough flavor for 60 days.</p>",
        "text_HxLlRArIJmteFgbd-1": "<p>How often can I use Lio?</p>",
        "text_egGiwJOsv5NMthvU-1": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It's completely natural and contains no nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so regular use is perfectly fine.</p>",
        "text_L5aVbbUojn7ExMCU-1": "<h3>Free yourself</h3>",
        "text_QCkYmfwX2ibUxS1M-1": "<h3><strong>from nicotine, vapor, </strong></h3><h3><strong>smoke & toxins.</strong></h3>",
        "text_3ZYUPwZh3VSo2Op4-1": "<h3>Free yourself</h3>",
        "text_g69xoOjK5TquUHqj-1": "<h3><strong>from nicotine, vapor, </strong></h3><h3><strong>smoke & toxins.</strong></h3>",
        "text_z3yKrEjQibuNbQDJ-1": "<h3>More than 100.000 </h3><h3>satisfied customers</h3>",
        "text_0rft8bt5UJMJxGbj-1": "<p>With an 80% success rate, Lio is 6x more effective than other methods.</p>",
        "text_IW3rOrBOrGae2Sug-1": "<p>Didn't stop? Money back.</p>",
        "text_cjuBH34JHBOKCuiC-1": "<p>We have so much confidence in Lio that if it doesn't work, you'll get your money back.</p>",
        "text_JOEtaBiBggQvWiDx-1": "<p>100% natural and chemical-free</p>",
        "text_Xu6aQYJ4lHYvN2bn-1": "<p>An all-natural way to curb cigarette cravings, without smoke, vapor, or nicotine.</p>",
        "text_rdj8lmDcb6pDHHv2-1": "<p>90% cheaper than your bad habit</p>",
        "text_cQ5dlvrP3ulI8kRm-1": "<p>Your wallet will thank you. Save thousands of euros a year while maintaining your freedom.</p>",
