        "url_Xpe2ptF7aOcofQeB": "#iWZtJqdCPWkjPMx0U",
        "text_97CCftanVe2KAyFB": "<p>Start My Journey</p>",
        "product_OoCDU8jnC3jIvnqn": "lio®-journey-pack",
        "text_AB7nHbiR6F4cZsxy": "<h3>The Only</h3>",
        "text_Z6qg0CIkxSSqHvzu": "<h3><strong>Alternative</strong></h3>",
        "text_b9AwhENM3i6tK3FO": "<p>\"Why is quitting so hard?\"</p>",
        "text_qCLp134Qzi0fbL1a": "<p><strong>Because most quitting methods rely on nicotine, keeping you stuck in the vicious cycle of addiction. </strong></p><p></p><p>Lio is different: no nicotine, no chemicals, just naturally flavored air that suppresses the craving for a cigarette while maintaining the familiar hand-to-mouth motion.</p>",
        "text_YaAf6hTgcw4FV1vz": "<p>The world's first</p>",
        "text_e8GfZmhhtwvo2OlO": "<h3>Flavoured</h3>",
        "text_FoR1RE8CNqHiJUZD": "<h3><strong>Air Diffuser</strong></h3>",
        "text_Vez8RWE87aANXTfn": "<p>The world's first</p>",
        "text_or661UxMspAZIxZ9": "<h3>Flavoured</h3>",
        "text_D5QIA7WT7dl85RKD": "<h3><strong>Air Diffuser</strong></h3>",
        "text_RhkHicdLSv2lkIeU": "<p>\"The diffuser that will change the way people quit forever.\"</p>",
        "text_yeQLiqLnkPiyt4ES": "<p>Quitting isn’t easy, but Lio makes it simpler by focusing on what actually works. Unlike other solutions that rely on nicotine or chemicals, Lio helps you naturally curb your cravings while maintaining the familiar habit of hand-to-mouth use. </p><p></p><p>No going cold turkey or frustrating with methods that don’t work. With Lio, you get a natural, stress-free way to quit, without the side effects. It’s a tool designed to support you, making quitting feel achievable and empowering you every step of the way.</p>",
        "text_07MH3GvqvLhI1pDt": "<p>Start My Journey</p>",
        "url_dt0fnTatYb0mZqCX": "#iWZtJqdCPWkjPMx0U",
        "text_fEcUdpYj0KJpCXXr": "<p>Start My Journey</p>",
        "text_WrTlG0pUcO7P155z": "<p>Didn't quit within 30 days? Get your money back!</p>",
        "text_TW5FUXk97F53WB7j": "<p>Rated 4.7/5 out of 1000+ reviews</p>",
        "text_hdjAVEfgbE8aXj5i": "<p>what our customers say</p>",
        "text_sVgv1i0ifGMiiS0R": "<p>Discover our customers' incredible success stories.</p>",
        "text_jbXCsxHBvmY7EfZR": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "text_Z4TSgp9Kd0HlkjsU": "<p>Simple and effective</p>",
        "text_W0IXKmH8KbyfdxnE": "<p>After a week of using Lio, I can already feel the difference. No smoke, no nicotine, just something to keep my hands busy without the guilt. A real lifesaver!</p>",
        "text_fQ1jgRpZ0UNUmkiZ": "<p>Zakaria Ernst</p><p>(9 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_MDSbwAuiuX3FZBLt": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "text_DzLTtmmY8bZuuudV": "<p>Lio saved my life</p>",
        "text_iwtN7F9U3aWBKsvB": "<p>I smoked almost 20 cigarettes a day. I tried many expensive ways to quit smoking, but unfortunately without success. I decided to try Lio, and after two weeks, I'm only using this. No anxiety attacks.</p>",
        "text_n3ffVVVrXa3Zkt0a": "<p>Pedro Kawal</p><p>(18 Days Ago )</p>",
        "text_pcGoRwQ9sdx47Sqk": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "text_xpD4oAZtFz6PG9pF": "<p>Helps me stay off cigarettes!</p>",
        "text_Yc4rAFhMdJyXyZoc": "<p>Lip has proven to be an excellent replacement for my needs. I lost my device, but they quickly sent a replacement, great product and service!</p>",
        "text_WPl2uWNNq6jHaazb": "<p>Josje Laan</p><p>(18 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_ccgAvlfkwM0upWhm": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "text_KpFtbCGv3ZBpnjth": "<p>I'm quitting after 35 years</p>",
        "text_113ldOYDXiAD9Qh5": "<p>After seeing my colleague with his Lio, I took the plunge. I'd smoked for 35 years, and quitting was hell. With Lio, it's self-explanatory, though I don't leave the house without it.</p>",
        "text_9KDH7hO5LDo2WlQl": "<p>Koen Bakker</p><p>(16 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_kwww7uJ6F6LiVzuR": "<p>Verified buyer</p>",
        "text_TBoWUffInUrHNXoU": "<p>Absolutely a game-changer!</p>",
        "text_nWgcd9KqQ6du9zyf": "<p>3 months nicotine-free thanks to Lio! The customer service was exceptional. I'm grateful for this product on my journey to quit smoking.</p>",
        "text_YfSqWWs9XPsW0mRc": "<p>Sofie Povis</p><p>(5 Days Ago)</p>",
        "url_ZDsgzjIhrtxIdg8g": "#iWZtJqdCPWkjPMx0U",
        "text_PR7b8UQQPyF8nBzF": "<p>Start my Journey</p>",
        "text_bl2bu0TKoBStE1aa": "<h3>The LIO DIFFUSER</h3>",
        "text_8FFfgYv6xK0CvoEG": "<h3>Explained</h3>",
        "text_3tMMLTCFEEm5wPmf": "<p>“Using Lio is as simple as it can be: designed for ease and effectiveness.”</p>",
        "text_adwHmcqYyQcZM2g8": "<p>Not complicated, just 3 simple steps:</p>",
